  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "38345170",
      "title": "Adding JavaScript To A Page & How React Projects Differ",
      "sourceHash": "3f8c3e03b6b6f888afc9117949fa0df4f52f79d4965b60f0512eb1cf3fe6a0f9",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 2.94,
          "en": "So let's start",
          "zh": "那麼我們就從"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.94,
          "end": 6.84,
          "en": "by revisiting certain crucial core concepts",
          "zh": "重溫一些關鍵的核心概念開始"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.84,
          "end": 10.05,
          "en": "and things you should know about JavaScript,",
          "zh": "以及你應該了解的 JavaScript 知識，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.05,
          "end": 13.08,
          "en": "for example, that JavaScript can be executed",
          "zh": "例如，JavaScript 可以在"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.08,
          "end": 15.06,
          "en": "in many different environments.",
          "zh": "許多不同的環境中執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.06,
          "end": 17.37,
          "en": "For example, of course, the browser,",
          "zh": "例如，當然，瀏覽器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.37,
          "end": 19.77,
          "en": "that's where JavaScript originated.",
          "zh": "那是 JavaScript 最初誕生的地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.77,
          "end": 22.38,
          "en": "In the end, that's what it was built for",
          "zh": "歸根究柢，它當初就是為此而打造"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.38,
          "end": 24,
          "en": "back in the nineties.",
          "zh": "早在九〇年代時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24,
          "end": 27.63,
          "en": "But nowadays, thanks to NodeJS and Deno,",
          "zh": "但時至今日，多虧了 NodeJS 與 Deno，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.63,
          "end": 31.02,
          "en": "for example, you can also execute JavaScript code",
          "zh": "你也可以在瀏覽器之外"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.02,
          "end": 32.85,
          "en": "outside of the browser.",
          "zh": "執行 JavaScript 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.85,
          "end": 35.37,
          "en": "This will not be the focus of this course",
          "zh": "這不是本課程的重點"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.37,
          "end": 37.32,
          "en": "because this is a React course",
          "zh": "因為這是一門 React 課程"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 37.32,
          "end": 39.96,
          "en": "and React is a client-side, front-end,",
          "zh": "而 React 本質上是一個用戶端、前端、"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 39.96,
          "end": 42.84,
          "en": "browser-based library in its core",
          "zh": "以瀏覽器為基礎的函式庫"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 42.84,
          "end": 45.93,
          "en": "that allows you to build user interfaces",
          "zh": "讓你藉由 React 與 JavaScript"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 45.93,
          "end": 48.15,
          "en": "with React and JavaScript.",
          "zh": "來建立使用者介面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.15,
          "end": 49.89,
          "en": "But it is of course worth knowing",
          "zh": "不過當然，值得知道的是"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 49.89,
          "end": 53.58,
          "en": "that JavaScript is not limited to the browser.",
          "zh": "JavaScript 並不侷限於瀏覽器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 53.58,
          "end": 57.09,
          "en": "You can even build mobile apps with JavaScript,",
          "zh": "你甚至可以用 JavaScript 打造行動應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 57.09,
          "end": 59.07,
          "en": "thanks to extra technologies",
          "zh": "多虧了一些額外技術"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 59.07,
          "end": 61.74,
          "en": "like Capacitor or React Native,",
          "zh": "例如 Capacitor 或 React Native，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 61.74,
          "end": 62.85,
          "en": "which by the way,",
          "zh": "順帶一提，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 62.85,
          "end": 64.56,
          "en": "would be a great next step",
          "zh": "這會是很棒的下一步"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 64.56,
          "end": 66.66,
          "en": "after finishing this course.",
          "zh": "在你完成這門課程之後。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 66.66,
          "end": 68.67,
          "en": "You can also use React",
          "zh": "你也可以將 React"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 68.67,
          "end": 71.1,
          "en": "in conjunction with another tool",
          "zh": "搭配另一個工具"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 71.1,
          "end": 73.26,
          "en": "or another library you could say,",
          "zh": "或者可以說另一個函式庫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 73.26,
          "end": 74.88,
          "en": "called React Native,",
          "zh": "叫做 React Native，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 74.88,
          "end": 77.07,
          "en": "to build native mobile apps",
          "zh": "來打造原生行動應用程式"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 77.07,
          "end": 79.26,
          "en": "for Android and iOS.",
          "zh": "適用於 Android 與 iOS。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 79.26,
          "end": 80.1,
          "en": "And I do have",
          "zh": "而我也有一門"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 80.1,
          "end": 82.41,
          "en": "a dedicated course on React Native",
          "zh": "專門講 React Native 的課程"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 82.41,
          "end": 83.94,
          "en": "if you wanna learn more about that",
          "zh": "如果你想進一步了解"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 83.94,
          "end": 85.8,
          "en": "after finishing this course.",
          "zh": "可以在完成這門課程之後去看看。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 85.8,
          "end": 89.64,
          "en": "So JavaScript is really versatile, really powerful.",
          "zh": "JavaScript 真的非常多才多藝、非常強大。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 89.64,
          "end": 91.74,
          "en": "But in this refresher section,",
          "zh": "但在這個複習章節中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 91.74,
          "end": 93,
          "en": "we are going to focus",
          "zh": "我們會聚焦在"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 93,
          "end": 95.1,
          "en": "on JavaScript in the browser,",
          "zh": "瀏覽器中的 JavaScript，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 95.1,
          "end": 96.87,
          "en": "though the general syntax",
          "zh": "不過一般的語法"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 96.87,
          "end": 98.16,
          "en": "and rules of course,",
          "zh": "與規則當然"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 98.16,
          "end": 99.75,
          "en": "are always the same,",
          "zh": "始終都一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 99.75,
          "end": 101.75999999999999,
          "en": "no matter for which environment",
          "zh": "無論你是為哪個環境"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 101.75999999999999,
          "end": 104.31,
          "en": "you are writing your JavaScript code.",
          "zh": "撰寫 JavaScript 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 104.31,
          "end": 107.43,
          "en": "So since we focus on JavaScript in the browser,",
          "zh": "既然我們聚焦在瀏覽器中的 JavaScript，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 107.43,
          "end": 109.11,
          "en": "let's explore how JavaScript code",
          "zh": "那就來看看 JavaScript 程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 109.11,
          "end": 111.27000000000001,
          "en": "can be added to a website.",
          "zh": "可以如何加入到網站中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 111.27000000000001,
          "end": 114.36,
          "en": "And here you have two main options",
          "zh": "這裡你有兩種主要選擇"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 114.36,
          "end": 117.84,
          "en": "and they both include the special script tag,",
          "zh": "它們都包含特殊的 script 標籤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 117.84,
          "end": 119.43,
          "en": "the special script element,",
          "zh": "也就是特殊的 script 元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 119.43,
          "end": 122.4,
          "en": "which you can add to your HTML code.",
          "zh": "你可以將它加入你的 HTML 程式碼中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 122.4,
          "end": 124.56,
          "en": "You can either put your JavaScript code",
          "zh": "你可以把 JavaScript 程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 124.56,
          "end": 126.54,
          "en": "between such script tags,",
          "zh": "放在這樣的 script 標籤之間，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 126.54,
          "end": 128.91,
          "en": "or you can use those script tags",
          "zh": "或者你可以用這些 script 標籤"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 128.91,
          "end": 131.37,
          "en": "to import JavaScript files,",
          "zh": "來匯入 JavaScript 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 131.37,
          "end": 134.37,
          "en": "which then contain your JavaScript code.",
          "zh": "這些檔案則包含你的 JavaScript 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 134.37,
          "end": 135.203,
          "en": "Now typically,",
          "zh": "一般來說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 135.203,
          "end": 137.91,
          "en": "we don't use that inline approach",
          "zh": "我們不會使用那種內嵌的做法"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 137.91,
          "end": 139.02,
          "en": "on the left here,",
          "zh": "也就是左邊這裡、"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 139.02,
          "end": 142.17000000000002,
          "en": "where the code is between those script tags,",
          "zh": "程式碼夾在那些 script 標籤之間的方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 142.17000000000002,
          "end": 143.55,
          "en": "because this approach",
          "zh": "因為這種做法"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 143.55,
          "end": 145.68,
          "en": "can quickly lead to unmaintainable",
          "zh": "很快就會導致難以維護"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 145.68,
          "end": 147.9,
          "en": "and complex HTML files,",
          "zh": "又複雜的 HTML 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 147.9,
          "end": 149.28,
          "en": "and is therefore typically",
          "zh": "因此通常"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 149.28,
          "end": 152.64,
          "en": "only used for very short scripts.",
          "zh": "只用於非常簡短的 script。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 152.64,
          "end": 153.72,
          "en": "Instead, typically,",
          "zh": "相反地，一般來說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 153.72,
          "end": 155.37,
          "en": "you have your JavaScript code",
          "zh": "你會把 JavaScript 程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 155.37,
          "end": 157.98,
          "en": "in dedicated JavaScript files",
          "zh": "放在專門的 JavaScript 檔案中"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 157.98,
          "end": 160.95,
          "en": "because such projects that use this approach",
          "zh": "因為使用這種做法的專案"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 160.95,
          "end": 163.8,
          "en": "are way easier to maintain.",
          "zh": "維護起來容易得多。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 163.8,
          "end": 165.96,
          "en": "Therefore, here in this demo project",
          "zh": "因此，在這個示範專案中"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 165.96,
          "end": 167.13,
          "en": "which I prepared,",
          "zh": "也就是我準備的這個專案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 167.13,
          "end": 169.41,
          "en": "we could start in this assets folder",
          "zh": "我們可以從這個 assets 資料夾開始"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 169.41,
          "end": 171.96,
          "en": "by adding a new sub-folder",
          "zh": "新增一個子資料夾"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 171.96,
          "end": 173.52,
          "en": "that could be called scripts,",
          "zh": "可以命名為 scripts，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 173.52,
          "end": 175.92000000000002,
          "en": "though the name of course doesn't matter.",
          "zh": "當然，名稱叫什麼都無所謂。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 175.92000000000002,
          "end": 176.753,
          "en": "And in there,",
          "zh": "然後在那裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 176.753,
          "end": 178.86,
          "en": "we can create a JavaScript code file",
          "zh": "我們可以建立一個 JavaScript 程式碼檔案"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 178.86,
          "end": 182.4,
          "en": "that could be named app.js.",
          "zh": "可以命名為 app.js。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 182.4,
          "end": 184.86,
          "en": "Though this name also is totally up to you,",
          "zh": "這個名稱也完全由你決定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 184.86,
          "end": 187.44,
          "en": "it just should end with .js,",
          "zh": "只要結尾是 .js 就好，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 187.44,
          "end": 189.57,
          "en": "so instead of course tells the browser",
          "zh": "因為這個副檔名當然會告訴瀏覽器"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 189.57,
          "end": 191.34,
          "en": "and also the Code Editor",
          "zh": "以及程式碼編輯器"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 191.34,
          "end": 194.253,
          "en": "that this file will contain JavaScript code.",
          "zh": "這個檔案會包含 JavaScript 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 195.21,
          "end": 197.07,
          "en": "And the Code Editor can therefore,",
          "zh": "因此，程式碼編輯器就能"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 197.07,
          "end": 199.35,
          "en": "for example, make sure that the code",
          "zh": "例如確保程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 199.35,
          "end": 202.17000000000002,
          "en": "is properly highlighted and formatted.",
          "zh": "有正確的語法高亮與格式化。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 202.17000000000002,
          "end": 204.3,
          "en": "Well, and with such a file added here,",
          "zh": "好的，加入這樣的檔案之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 204.3,
          "end": 207.96,
          "en": "you can then import it in the HTML file",
          "zh": "你就可以在 HTML 檔案中匯入它"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 207.96,
          "end": 209.52,
          "en": "by going there",
          "zh": "到那裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 209.52,
          "end": 212.1,
          "en": "and adding your script tags,",
          "zh": "加入你的 script 標籤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 212.1,
          "end": 214.68,
          "en": "opening and closing script tags.",
          "zh": "開始與結束的 script 標籤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 214.68,
          "end": 216.96,
          "en": "And you always need both.",
          "zh": "你永遠都需要成對使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 216.96,
          "end": 219.84,
          "en": "You can't use a self-closing script tag",
          "zh": "你不能使用自閉合的 script 標籤"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 219.84,
          "end": 221.07,
          "en": "or anything like this.",
          "zh": "或任何類似的寫法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 221.07,
          "end": 222.54,
          "en": "Instead, you need opening",
          "zh": "相反地，你需要開始"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 222.54,
          "end": 224.1,
          "en": "and closing script tags.",
          "zh": "與結束的 script 標籤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 224.1,
          "end": 225.723,
          "en": "That's a must have.",
          "zh": "這是必須的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 226.62,
          "end": 227.73,
          "en": "Now you can add them",
          "zh": "你可以把它們加在"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 227.73,
          "end": 229.95,
          "en": "anywhere you want in that file.",
          "zh": "檔案中任何你想要的位置。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 229.95,
          "end": 231.51,
          "en": "In the head section,",
          "zh": "在 head 區段、"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 231.51,
          "end": 232.98,
          "en": "in the body section,",
          "zh": "在 body 區段，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 232.98,
          "end": 235.47,
          "en": "really, anywhere you want.",
          "zh": "真的，任何你想要的地方都可以。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 235.47,
          "end": 238.17000000000002,
          "en": "And then you would add the source attribute,",
          "zh": "然後你會加入 source 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 238.17000000000002,
          "end": 239.97,
          "en": "the src attribute",
          "zh": "也就是 src 屬性"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 239.97,
          "end": 241.71,
          "en": "to point at the file.",
          "zh": "指向那個檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 241.71,
          "end": 243.87,
          "en": "In my case, in the assets folder.",
          "zh": "在我的例子中，是在 assets 資料夾。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 243.87,
          "end": 245.58,
          "en": "And there in the scripts folder",
          "zh": "而在那裡面的 scripts 資料夾"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 245.58,
          "end": 247.263,
          "en": "that should be imported.",
          "zh": "就是應該被匯入的檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 248.43,
          "end": 250.23,
          "en": "And now that file would be loaded",
          "zh": "這麼一來，這個檔案就會被載入"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 250.23,
          "end": 251.67,
          "en": "as part of this webpage",
